# THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES

This repository is distributed under GNU AGPL-3.0. It also depends on third-party libraries and tools that remain under their own licenses.

This file is the Sprint 0 baseline notices artifact for Sockseek UI. It serves two purposes:

1. keep a tracked inventory of the third-party components currently referenced by the repository; and
2. define the minimum release-time expectation that public binary/installer/container releases must bundle or link the exact corresponding third-party notices for the shipped dependency set.

## Release-time expectation

Before any public release:

- verify the exact dependency graph for the shipped build configuration;
- collect the applicable third-party notice texts and/or license texts for redistributed components;
- update this file if the dependency set changed materially;
- include this file, or a release-specific generated equivalent, in the published artifact as required by `docs/release-checklist.md` and `docs/LEGAL.md`.

This baseline file is intentionally conservative: it records the dependency inventory visible from the repository today, but it does not claim that the lists below are a complete substitute for a release-specific legal review.

