## Source of truth for future updates

When this file is refreshed, prefer evidence from:

- `*.csproj`
- `packages.lock.json`
- the resolved NuGet dependency graph for the release build
- upstream package metadata and license/notice texts

Do not remove this file from release artifacts merely because a generated notice file is introduced later; replace it only with an equivalent or more complete artifact.
